    [4906]={name="Rainwalker Boots",quality=1,ilvl=7,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rite of Vision'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Zarlman Two-Moons in Mulgore. Objective: Consume the Water of the Seers in front of the tribal fire in Bloodhoof Village and follow the vision once it appears. Provided item:.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Rite of Vision",lore="I now present you with the Water of the Seers. When you are ready, consume the waters near the tribal fire. Once you have ingested the holy waters, it will take a few moments before the vision materializes before the fire."},
    [4907]={name="Woodland Tunic",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Webwood Egg'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gilshalan Windwalker in Teldrassil. Objective: Bring a Webwood Egg to Gilshalan in Aldrassil.",zone="Shadowglen",questName="Webwood Egg",lore="Now that I have the spiders' venom, I'd like some live specimens to study. Unfortunately, capturing a living, giant spider is more than I can ask of you, young."},
    [4908]={name="Nomadic Bracers",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Hunt Continues'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Grull Hawkwind in Mulgore. Objective: Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to bring him 10 Mountain Cougar Pelts.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="The Hunt Continues",lore="A tauren skilled in the ways of the hunt knows that his prey is not for mere trophy. The beasts of the plains provide us with a means of survival."},
    [4914]={name="Battleworn Leather Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cutting Teeth'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gornek in Durotar. Objective: Kill 10 Mottled Boars then return to Gornek at the Den.",zone="Valley of Trials",questName="Cutting Teeth",lore="The first order of business will be to put a little strength in your backbone. I could send you out to the Barrens to hunt kodo, but well, in all honesty, you're more useful to us alive than dead."},
    [4915]={name="Soft Wool Boots",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cutting Teeth'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gornek in Durotar. Objective: Kill 10 Mottled Boars then return to Gornek at the Den.",zone="Valley of Trials",questName="Cutting Teeth",lore="The first order of business will be to put a little strength in your backbone. I could send you out to the Barrens to hunt kodo, but well, in all honesty, you're more useful to us alive than dead."},
    [4916]={name="Soft Wool Vest",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Sarkoth'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Hana'zua in Durotar. Objective: Kill Sarkoth and bring his claw back to Hana'zua.",zone="Valley of Trials",questName="Sarkoth",lore="Seeing the deed you have done for me steels my heart. I cannot fall so easily! I must endure! But it remains that I cannot make the trek back to the Den unassisted."},
    [4919]={name="Soft Wool Belt",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Sting of the Scorpid'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gornek in Durotar. Objective: Get 10 Scorpid Worker Tails for Gornek in the Den.",zone="Valley of Trials",questName="Sting of the Scorpid",lore="Powerful warrior and awkward novice alike have fallen to the venomous sting of the scorpid. You will find large numbers of scorpids northwest of here."},
    [4920]={name="Battleworn Cape",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Sting of the Scorpid'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gornek in Durotar. Objective: Get 10 Scorpid Worker Tails for Gornek in the Den.",zone="Valley of Trials",questName="Sting of the Scorpid",lore="Powerful warrior and awkward novice alike have fallen to the venomous sting of the scorpid. You will find large numbers of scorpids northwest of here."},
    [4921]={name="Dust-covered Leggings",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Burning Blade Medallion'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Zureetha Fargaze in Durotar. Objective: Bring the Burning Blade Medallion to Zureetha Fargaze, outside The Den.",zone="Valley of Trials",questName="Burning Blade Medallion",lore="Through my divinations, I see that an item of power hides deep within the Burning Blade Coven, guarded by beasts and black magic. It is called the Burning Blade Medallion, and your next task is to find it and remove it from the coven."},
    [4925]={name="Primitive Hand Blade",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Vile Familiars'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Zureetha Fargaze in Durotar. Objective: Kill 12 Vile Familiars.Return to Zureetha Fargaze outside the Den.",zone="Durotar",questName="Vile Familiars",lore="I was sent to the Valley to guide you, but I have discovered a growing taint here... A group that calls itself the Burning Blade has a coven here in the Valley of Trials."},
    [4928]={name="Sandrunner Wristguards",quality=1,ilvl=8,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'From The Wreckage....'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gar'Thok in Durotar. Objective: Gar'Thok of Razor Hill wants you to retrieve 3 Gnomish Tools from the wreckage off the coast.",zone="Durotar",questName="From The Wreckage....",lore="One of my most observant scouts brings back word that the wreckage of Proudmoore's fleet still remains off the coast of Durotar, just east of Tiragarde Keep."},
    [4929]={name="Light Scorpid Armor",quality=1,ilvl=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Need for a Cure'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rhinag in Durotar. Objective: Find Kor'ghan in Orgrimmar and get the Venomtail Antidote. Then bring the antidote to Rhinag near the northwestern border of Durotar.",zone="Durotar",questName="Need for a Cure",lore="... your timing is perfect. I just hope I can compliment your haste as well. I was careless while fighting a few of the venomtails nearby, and one of them stung me deeply."},
    [4931]={name="Hickory Shortbow",quality=1,ilvl=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Securing the Lines'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rezlak in Durotar. Objective: Kill 12 Dustwind Savages and 8 Dustwind Storm Witches for Rezlak near Drygulch Ravine.",zone="Durotar",questName="Securing the Lines",lore="Gazlowe told me once, \"Rezlak. There's one thing you need to know in life, and that's if you want something done well, do it yourself.\" I can't deal with losing all our caravans, so I'm just going to take matters into my own hands."},
    [4933]={name="Seasoned Fighter's Cloak",quality=1,ilvl=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Thwarting Kolkar Aggression'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Lar Prowltusk in Durotar. Objective: Lar Prowltusk outside of Sen'jin Village wants you to destroy the 3 sets of Attack Plans held within Kolkar Crag.",zone="Durotar",questName="Thwarting Kolkar Aggression",lore="Lower your voice. The Kolkar centaurs lie just over the ridge to the west in Kolkar Crag."},
    [4936]={name="Dirt-trodden Boots",quality=1,ilvl=8,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'From The Wreckage....'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gar'Thok in Durotar. Objective: Gar'Thok of Razor Hill wants you to retrieve 3 Gnomish Tools from the wreckage off the coast.",zone="Durotar",questName="From The Wreckage....",lore="One of my most observant scouts brings back word that the wreckage of Proudmoore's fleet still remains off the coast of Durotar, just east of Tiragarde Keep."},
    [4938]={name="Blemished Wooden Staff",quality=1,ilvl=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Securing the Lines'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rezlak in Durotar. Objective: Kill 12 Dustwind Savages and 8 Dustwind Storm Witches for Rezlak near Drygulch Ravine.",zone="Durotar",questName="Securing the Lines",lore="Gazlowe told me once, \"Rezlak. There's one thing you need to know in life, and that's if you want something done well, do it yourself.\" I can't deal with losing all our caravans, so I'm just going to take matters into my own hands."},
    [4939]={name="Steady Bastard Sword",quality=2,ilvl=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Skull Rock'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Margoz in Durotar. Objective: Gather Searing Collars from the cultists in Skull Rock.Bring them to Margoz at his camp.",zone="Durotar",questName="Skull Rock",lore=". The Burning Blade has infested the cave east of Orgrimmar known as Skull Rock. Inside that cave they perform vile rituals, and burn their own flesh with Searing Collars."},
    [4940]={name="Veiled Grips",quality=1,ilvl=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Zalazane'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Master Gadrin in Durotar. Objective: Defeat Zalazane.Kill 8 Voodoo Trolls and 8 Hexed Trolls.Bring Zalazane's Head to Gadrin.",zone="Durotar",questName="Zalazane",lore="The witchdoctor Zalazane dwells on the Echo Isles to the east. They are the isles we once called home. From there he sends his trolls to the mainland, to hex our people and drag more of them under his sway."},
    [4942]={name="Tiger Hide Boots",quality=1,ilvl=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Dark Storms'. Starts with Orgnil Soulscar in Durotar. Objective: Bring Fizzle's Claw to Orgnil Soulscar in Razor Hill.",zone="Durotar",questName="Dark Storms",lore="We cannot allow the Burning Blade a foothold in Durotar! We must destroy them before their evil festers!"},
    [4944]={name="Handsewn Cloak",quality=1,ilvl=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Lost But Not Forgotten'. Starts with Misha Tor'kren in Durotar. Objective: Bring a sign of Kron's fate to Misha Tor'kren at the farmstead northwest of Razor Hill.",zone="Durotar",questName="Lost But Not Forgotten",lore="please, can you help me? My son Kron went hunting days ago, and he still hasn't returned. He went west towards the Barrens to hunt crocolisks along Southfury River."},
    [4947]={name="Jagged Dagger",quality=2,ilvl=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Skull Rock'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Margoz in Durotar. Objective: Gather Searing Collars from the cultists in Skull Rock.Bring them to Margoz at his camp.",zone="Durotar",questName="Skull Rock",lore=". The Burning Blade has infested the cave east of Orgrimmar known as Skull Rock. Inside that cave they perform vile rituals, and burn their own flesh with Searing Collars."},
    [4951]={name="Squealer's Belt",quality=1,ilvl=7,reqLevel=1,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from \"Squealer\" Thornmantle.",zone="Kalimdor",npc="\"Squealer\" Thornmantle"},
    [4954]={name="Nomadic Belt",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Hunt Begins'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Grull Hawkwind in Mulgore. Objective: Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to bring him 7 Plainstrider Feathers and 7 pieces of Plainstrider Meat.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="The Hunt Begins",lore="You have a promising air about you, and will prove yourself to the tribe. Perhaps someday soon you will be welcomed into the great city of Thunder Bluff."},
    [4958]={name="Sun-beaten Cloak",quality=1,ilvl=8,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rite of Vision'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Zarlman Two-Moons in Mulgore. Objective: Consume the Water of the Seers in front of the tribal fire in Bloodhoof Village and follow the vision once it appears. Provided item:.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Rite of Vision",lore="I now present you with the Water of the Seers. When you are ready, consume the waters near the tribal fire. Once you have ingested the holy waters, it will take a few moments before the vision materializes before the fire."},
    [4961]={name="Dreamwatcher Staff",quality=1,ilvl=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wildmane Cleansing'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mull Thunderhorn in Mulgore. Objective: Use the Wildmane Cleansing Totem at the Wildmane Water Well, then return to Mull Thunderhorn.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Wildmane Cleansing",lore="Your cleansing of the Winterhoof and Thunderhorn wells is spoken among the spirits, young. The Wildmane Totem is made, and your last task lies ahead."},
    [4962]={name="Double-layered Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=8,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gathering Leather'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Veren Tallstrider in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Bring 12 pieces of Light Leather to Veren Tallstrider in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Gathering Leather",lore="Greetings, young one. You have a gleam in your eye; I can tell you are eager to venture back to the plains for the hunt. May you bring honor to your clan!"},
    [4963]={name="Thunderhorn Cloak",quality=1,ilvl=8,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Thunderhorn Cleansing'. Starts with Mull Thunderhorn in Mulgore. Objective: Use the Thunderhorn Cleansing Totem at the Thunderhorn Water Well, then return to Mull.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Thunderhorn Cleansing",lore="And again, it is your task to perform the ritual of cleansing. Go to the Thunderhorn Water Well, north of the village, and use the Thunderhorn Cleansing Totem in your ritual."},
    [4968]={name="Bound Harness",quality=1,ilvl=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Preparation for Ceremony'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Eyahn Eagletalon in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Collect 6 Azure Feathers and 6 Bronze Feathers, and bring them to Eyahn Eagletalon in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Preparation for Ceremony",lore="my brother soon stands before Chief Bloodhoof, and it is my honor to make his headdress for him. I want to ask a favor of you while I finish tanning these leather straps."},
    [4970]={name="Rough-hewn Kodo Leggings",quality=1,ilvl=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Dwarven Digging'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Baine Bloodhoof in Mulgore. Objective: Collect 5 Prospector's Picks.At a forge, smash the Prospector's Picks to create Broken Tools.Bring 5 Broken Tools to Baine Bloodhoof in Bloodhoof Village.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Dwarven Digging",lore="There are dwarves preparing a dig site to the northwest. They think secrets lie in the earth, and that is true, but hollowing and defiling the land is no way to earn its teachings."},
    [4973]={name="Plains Hunter Wristguards",quality=1,ilvl=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mazzranache'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Maur Raincaller in Mulgore. Objective: Bring a Prairie Wolf Heart, Flatland Cougar Femur, Plainstrider Scale and Swoop Gizzard to Maur Raincaller at Bloodhoof Village.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Mazzranache",lore="He told me of its demonic red eyes, razor-sharp talons and venomous bite. As fortune would have it, while traveling across the plains, I encountered it, and it took a nasty bite from my shoulder."},
    [4974]={name="Compact Fighting Knife",quality=2,ilvl=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Supervisor Fizsprocket'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Morin Cloudstalker in Mulgore. Objective: Kill Supervisor Fizsprocket and return his clipboard to Morin Cloudstalker at Bloodhoof Village.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Supervisor Fizsprocket",lore="According to the documents you salvaged from the caravan, the Venture Co. created many plans to attempt to drive us from our lands here, so that they could have free reign to plunder our lands."},
    [5344]={name="Pointed Axe",quality=2,ilvl=14,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bracers'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Regthar Deathgate in The Barrens. Objective: Bring 15 Centaur Bracers to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Centaur Bracers",lore="The Kolkar are a threat to the Horde's claims in the Barrens; we must reduce the numbers of their troops. And so, I have a bounty task for you."},
    [5346]={name="Orcish Battle Bow",quality=2,ilvl=14,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bracers'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Regthar Deathgate in The Barrens. Objective: Bring 15 Centaur Bracers to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Centaur Bracers",lore="The Kolkar are a threat to the Horde's claims in the Barrens; we must reduce the numbers of their troops. And so, I have a bounty task for you."},
    [5394]={name="Archery Training Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Balance of Nature'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Conservator Ilthalaine in Teldrassil. Objective: Kill 7 Young Nightsabers and 4 Young Thistle Boars and return to Conservator Ilthalaine.",zone="Shadowglen",questName="The Balance of Nature",lore="Greetings. I am Conservator Ilthalaine. My purpose in Shadowglen is to ensure that the balance of nature is maintained."},
    [5398]={name="Canopy Leggings",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Woodland Protector'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Tarindrella in Teldrassil. Objective: Collect 8 Fel Moss and bring them to Tarindrella.",zone="Shadowglen",questName="The Woodland Protector",lore="Something evil is brewing in the forests of Teldrassil. Look long the hills to where the peaceful furbolgs used to dwell. They have deserted their homes and are amassing under the name of the Gnarlpine tribe."},
    [5405]={name="Draped Cloak",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Balance of Nature'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Conservator Ilthalaine in Teldrassil. Objective: Kill 7 Young Nightsabers and 4 Young Thistle Boars and return to Conservator Ilthalaine.",zone="Shadowglen",questName="The Balance of Nature",lore="Thinning the younger population of creatures here in Shadowglen was a good start, but there is still work to be done. The resources of the forest will be depleted too quickly if the problem is not addressed."},
    [5419]={name="Feral Bracers",quality=1,ilvl=7,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Twisted Hatred'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Tallonkai Swiftroot in Teldrassil. Objective: Kill 8 Befouled Webwoods and bring Xethorr the Wicked's Mature Fel Moss to Tallonkai Swiftroot in Dolanaar.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Twisted Hatred",lore="I must warn you, this matter must stay between us. The satyr are enough of an embarrassment to us already, and this one is much too close to home."},
    [5420]={name="Banshee Armor",quality=2,ilvl=14,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Demon Seed'. Starts with Ak'Zeloth in The Barrens. Objective: Grab a Flawed Power Stone. Bring it to the Altar of Fire before the stone expires, then return to Ak'Zeloth.",zone="Durotar",questName="The Demon Seed",lore="The Demon Seed is a powerful tool for the Burning Legion. It rests in a cave on Dreadmist Peak, above a demonic altar of fire. I have prepared power stones that when placed near the Seed will disrupt its connection to the Legion."},
    [5459]={name="Defender Axe",quality=2,ilvl=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ursal the Mauler'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Athridas Bearmantle in Teldrassil. Objective: Kill Ursal the Mauler and return to Athridas Bearmantle in Dolanaar.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Ursal the Mauler",lore="Now the time has come to save the Druids of the Talon. If we fail now, they will be forever lost in sleep. I shall prepare the Relics of Wakening and perform the ritual."},
    [5581]={name="Smooth Walking Staff",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Stolen Journal'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Grelin Whitebeard in Dun Morogh. Objective: Grelin Whitebeard wants you to kill Grik'nir the Cold, and retrieve his journal.",zone="Coldridge Valley",questName="The Stolen Journal",lore="My journal! They took it away to the cave. The one that had it... It was a big brute with some odd markings on his skin and face. I didn't get a much better look than that."},
    [5591]={name="Rain-spotted Cape",quality=1,ilvl=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Enchanted Glade'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak in Teldrassil. Objective: Acquire 6 Bloodfeather Belts and bring them to Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak in the Oracle Glade.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Enchanted Glade",lore="I was dispatched with a small group of Sentinels here to protect the Oracle Tree from the harpies that have made nests all around the glade."},
    [5596]={name="Ashwood Bow",quality=1,ilvl=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Crown of the Earth'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Corithras Moonrage in Darnassus. Objective: Bring the Filled Vessel to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Crown of the Earth",lore="Without the blessings of Alexstrasza the Life-Binder and Nozdormu the Timeless, Teldrassil's growth has not been without flaw."},
    [5606]={name="Gardening Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Timberling Sprouts'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Denalan in Teldrassil. Objective: Bring 12 Timberling Sprouts to Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Timberling Sprouts",lore="Small timberlings are sprouting around the waters of Lake Al'Ameth. I'm afraid these sprouts are beyond help -- we should try to clear them from the land before they grow large enough to cause trouble."},
    [5612]={name="Ivy Cuffs",quality=1,ilvl=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Tools of the Highborne'. Starts with Thundris Windweaver in Darkshore. Objective: Retrieve 7 Highborne Relics for Thundris Windweaver in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Tools of the Highborne",lore=". A task I would ask of you. Have you seen the ruins of Ameth'Aran? If not, you will find them on the eastern side of the main road, some ways to the south."},
    [5617]={name="Vagabond Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bashal'Aran'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Asterion in Darkshore. Objective: Destroy the Ancient Moonstone Seal at the ancient flame in Ameth'Aran, then return to Asterion in Bashal'Aran.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Bashal'Aran",lore="It was the craft of one of the most powerful of the Highborne that created the seal that formed my prison. In Ameth'Aran, the ruins to the south that are twin to these, persists even today an ancient flame, blue in color."},
    [5744]={name="Pale Skinner",quality=2,ilvl=12,reqLevel=7,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Fedfennel (rare spawn).",zone="Eastern Kingdoms",npc="Fedfennel"},
    [5776]={name="Elder's Cane",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rite of Strength'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Seer Graytongue in Mulgore. Objective: Kill Bristlebacks in Brambleblade Ravine and bring 12 Bristleback Belts to Chief Hawkwind in Camp Narache.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="Rite of Strength",lore="The Rites of the Earthmother are the steps a young tauren needs to take to gain respect in Thunder Bluff. First you must pass the Rite of Strength."},
    [5777]={name="Brave's Axe",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rite of Strength'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Seer Graytongue in Mulgore. Objective: Kill Bristlebacks in Brambleblade Ravine and bring 12 Bristleback Belts to Chief Hawkwind in Camp Narache.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="Rite of Strength",lore="The Rites of the Earthmother are the steps a young tauren needs to take to gain respect in Thunder Bluff. First you must pass the Rite of Strength."},
    [5778]={name="Primitive Walking Stick",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Vile Familiars'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Zureetha Fargaze in Durotar. Objective: Kill 12 Vile Familiars.Return to Zureetha Fargaze outside the Den.",zone="Durotar",questName="Vile Familiars",lore="I trust the Valley of Trials will teach you much, young. I was sent to the Valley to guide you, but I have discovered a growing taint here..."},
    [5779]={name="Forsaken Bastard Sword",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Scarlet Crusade'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Executor Arren in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: Bring Executor Arren 12 Scarlet Armbands from Scarlet Converts and Scarlet Initiates.",zone="Deathknell",questName="The Scarlet Crusade",lore="You'll be happy to know we appear to be making progress in the mine, thanks in no small part to your efforts. We can now turn our eyes to other concerns."},
    [5936]={name="Animal Skin Belt",quality=1,ilvl=8,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gathering Leather'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Veren Tallstrider in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Bring 12 pieces of Light Leather to Veren Tallstrider in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Gathering Leather",lore="Greetings, young one. You have a gleam in your eye; I can tell you are eager to venture back to the plains for the hunt. May you bring honor to your clan!"},
    [5939]={name="Sewing Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=8,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Chill of Death'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gretchen Dedmar in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: Bring five Duskbat Pelts and some Coarse Thread to Gretchen Dedmar in Brill.",zone="Tirisfal Glades",questName="The Chill of Death",lore="It's so cold, now. The Plague of Undeath crawls through my veins like an icy serpent. The Mindless State will be upon me soon. But no doomed destiny will prevent me from serving our Dark Lady."},
    [5957]={name="Handstitched Leather Vest",quality=2,ilvl=8,reqLevel=3,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [6058]={name="Blackened Leather Belt",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Balance of Nature'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Conservator Ilthalaine in Teldrassil. Objective: Kill 7 Young Nightsabers and 4 Young Thistle Boars and return to Conservator Ilthalaine.",zone="Shadowglen",questName="The Balance of Nature",lore="Thinning the younger population of creatures here in Shadowglen was a good start, but there is still work to be done. The resources of the forest will be depleted too quickly if the problem is not addressed."},
    [6059]={name="Nomadic Vest",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Battleboars'. Starts with Grull Hawkwind in Mulgore. Objective: Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to kill Battleboars and bring back 8 Battleboar Snouts and 8 Battleboar Flanks.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="The Battleboars",lore="The Battleboars of Brambleblade Ravine to the east are encroaching on our tribal hunting grounds. They are trained to be malicious by the Bristleback Quilboars with whom we are at war."},
    [6060]={name="Flax Bracers",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Damned'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Novice Elreth in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: Novice Elreth requires 6 Scavenger Paws and 6 Duskbat Wings.",zone="Deathknell",questName="The Damned",lore="My duties include tending to our wounded warriors, tailoring armor and clothes, and assisting Shadow Priest Sarvis with whatever else he might need."},
    [6070]={name="Wolfskin Bracers",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wolves Across the Border'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Eagan Peltskinner in Elwynn Forest. Objective: Bring 8 pieces of Tough Wolf Meat to Eagan Peltskinner outside Northshire Abbey.",zone="Northshire Valley",questName="Wolves Across the Border",lore="I hate those nasty timber wolves! But I sure like eating wolf steaks... Bring me tough wolf meat and I will exchange it for something you'll find useful."},
    [6076]={name="Tapered Pants",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bounty on Garrick Padfoot'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Deputy Willem in Elwynn Forest. Objective: Kill Garrick Padfoot and bring his head to Deputy Willem at Northshire Abbey.",zone="Northshire Valley",questName="Bounty on Garrick Padfoot",lore="Garrick Padfoot - a cutthroat who's plagued our farmers and merchants for weeks - was seen at a shack near the vineyards, which lies east of the Abbey and across the bridge."},
    [6085]={name="Footman Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wanted: \"Hogger\"'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Elwynn Forest",questName="Wanted:  \"Hogger\"",lore="Wanted: Hogger A huge gnoll, Hogger, is prowling the woods in southwestern Elwynn. He has overpowered all attempts at his capture. The Stormwind Army has placed a generous bounty on the Gnoll."},
    [6098]={name="Neophyte's Robe",quality=0,ilvl=1,reqLevel=1,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Thomas Yance.",zone="Old Hillsbrad Foothills",npc="Thomas Yance"},
    [6171]={name="Wolf Handler Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Dwarven Outfitters'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Sten Stoutarm in Dun Morogh. Objective: Sten Stoutarm would like 8 pieces of Tough Wolf Meat.",zone="Coldridge Valley",questName="Dwarven Outfitters",lore="You look as though you might need something to keep your hands warm, hm? I'll tell you what would help: a pair of nice, warm gloves."},
    [6173]={name="Snow Boots",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A New Threat'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Balir Frosthammer in Dun Morogh. Objective: Balir Frosthammer wants you to kill 6 Rockjaw Troggs and 6 Burly Rockjaw Troggs.",zone="Coldridge Valley",questName="A New Threat",lore="I hope you're here to lend us a hand. After the last trogg attack, we could use all the help we can get. I hear the buggers have been popping up all across the lands, and it seems Coldridge Valley is no exception."},
    [6185]={name="Bear Shawl",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A New Threat'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Balir Frosthammer in Dun Morogh. Objective: Balir Frosthammer wants you to kill 6 Rockjaw Troggs and 6 Burly Rockjaw Troggs.",zone="Coldridge Valley",questName="A New Threat",lore="I hope you're here to lend us a hand. After the last trogg attack, we could use all the help we can get. I hear the buggers have been popping up all across the lands, and it seems Coldridge Valley is no exception."},
